    "description": "<p>This unit allows a Droid to receive instructions from a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Remote_Processor\" title=\"Remote Processor\">Remote Processor</a>. Only Droids without internal Processors (such as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/B1_Series_Battle_Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"B1 Series Battle Droid\">B1 Series Battle Droids</a>) can be fitted with <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Remote Receivers</strong>. A <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Remote Receiver</strong> can only be connected to one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Remote_Processor\" title=\"Remote Processor\">Remote Processor</a> at a time. Changing the connection to a different <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Remote_Processor\" title=\"Remote Processor\">Remote Processor</a> requires a DC 20 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check and a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Tool_Kit\" title=\"Tool Kit\">Tool Kit</a>.</p>",
    "cost": "-500",
    "weight": "1 Kilogram"
  },
